(text "POWER / DEFAULT-OFF LED SWITCH" (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "821f655c-1fcd-5ff7-ab30-97655960e9ca"))
(text "MCU / DUAL DATA / SERVICE" (at 210 20 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "3ff46967-e225-5e50-a984-3f60c97acbe6"))
(text "PASSIVE CV THRU / SENSING / ADC" (at 400 20 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "a3516531-e11a-51f5-9c7a-90aa3b321d2a"))
(text "Identical net labels are connected. U6 senses through 20 Mohm; U7 buffers the ADC.\nADC=(100/133)*(VDD/2+CV/8). TPS2552-1 uses active-low EN; PA5 HIGH enables via NPN.\nJ1/J2 SOFNG PJ-324M (pin identities INFERRED, R1 #16): 1 sleeve + 2 ring = GND, 4 TIP = CV_THRU, normals 3/5 unused.\nSW1 hanxia HX MSK13C02 side switch on the PCM13SMTR land: 3 common = GND. POS1 1-3 ON (A=0,B=1); POS2 open PROGRAM (1,1); POS3 3-4 CV (1,0).\nPower transients, MLCC bias, fault heat and connector continuity require hardware tests." (at 20 397 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "6e3a9232-9719-5faf-a5c9-719754cc44ab"))
